-"118","sdherald_18571003","""San Diego Herald""",1857-10-03,2,"na","""https://cdnc.ucr.edu/?a=d&d=SDH18571003.2.3&srpos=2&e=-------en--20-SDH-1--txt-txIN-turtle-------""","“Capt. J. C. Bogart, arrived here on Friday, from the lower coast, with 120 fine turtles, in good condition. He lost 60 by the breaking of the corral, which, with fifty that broke away some weeks ago, here, makes quite a loss. Wisdom comes with experience, as well in the construction of turtle pens as in other things.”","2","""The Sch Elizabeth Owens,""","120","green","inferred","inferred",NA,NA,"not_reported","""the location was not further specified beyond the 'lower coast', so it is assumed to be baja""","1857",7,"high",120,NA,NA,1850,"baja_california","na","baja_california","mexico",30.3593768,-115.5309449
