+"91","stinson_sdunion_18900617","""San Diego Union and Daily Bee""",1890-06-17,NA,"47","""https://georgehbalazs.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/Stinson_1984_BiologyofSeaTurtlesSanDiegoBayCAinNEPacOcean_Thesis_SDSU.pdf""","""At this time of the year there are numerous sea turtles in False [Mission] Bay, and during last week two men who make a business of catching the monsters were quite successful, clearing $98 for the week's work. The turtles were delivered in the city are worth four cents per pound at the restaurants.""","1","""History of Sea Turtles in San Diego Bay""","not_reported","green","inferred","mission_bay","known","not_reported","not_reported","not_reported","""sold for meat, but number not specified. Not enough to be consistent large cargo, but numerous""","1890",5,"medium",NA,NA,NA,1890
